// ── GPIO self-test (diagnostic) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
// Drives every board control pin LOW then HIGH, reading the pad input buffer
// back each time (the actual pin voltage — see gpio_verify.c), to find a control
// line that can't follow its output: shorted to a rail, a dead driver, or an
// external fault. DISRUPTIVE — it momentarily toggles power-enable / select /
